        "AC-7 (Confirmation message with host when unreferenced): exact message string matches AC wording; confirmed by AC-T7 test.",
        "AC-8 (add() sends PUT without id): confirmed by api.config.test.mjs test — body.id is undefined.",
        "AC-9 (update(id,data) sends PUT with id in body): confirmed by api.config.test.mjs test.",
        "AC-10 (remove(id) sends DELETE /:id): confirmed by api.config.test.mjs test — URL contains credential id, not host string.",
        "AC-11 (all tests pass): settings.test.mjs 17/17, api.config.test.mjs 23/23.",
        "Regression: all other test suites pass — repositories.test.mjs (6), repository-detail.test.mjs (24), workspace-detail (26), dashboard.test.mjs (14), repo-status-cells.test.mjs (21), api.errorLog.test.mjs (6), api.workspaces.launch.test.mjs (13), normalise.test.mjs (16). No regressions introduced.",
