          "note": "settings.js buildCredentialRow() saveBtn handler (line 183): no client-side validation guard for empty label before calling api.config.credentials.update(). A user can save an empty string as the label — the server should reject this, but adding a client-side isEmpty check would match the pattern used in the Add form (validateRequired). Not an AC requirement but worth addressing in a follow-up."
